{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　こんばちは　雨が降ったり止んだりな日私が外に出ている時は一度も雨が降りませんでした😶でも休みの日はいつも雨なんですよね、、、間をとって曇り女です😶🌫　佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒　　　お知らせ🐻‍❄️本日21:00〜日本テレビ「ワールドドキドキビデオ」出演させていただきます！ずーっとドキドキ止まらない時間でした🫀一緒に真顔チャレンジしてみてください😶\n24:20〜テレビ朝日「みえる」今日は月に一回地上波の日です！絶対観てね〜🧚‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PK98DPC6JVQ3HP4JF6RR2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n猫見つけました〜🐈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミーグリの写真載せます💜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PKA9FE0WZ04GX91YKCWS8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PKBDSSST29RVXA3WE8ZEP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">黒のスラックスは一本持っていれば無敵グッズですね🌚"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PKCJ4Q851M87V6S6EFVAD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nトップスはPUBLIC TOKYOです🪐肩がさりげなく空いていてサラサラしていてとーってもお気に入り〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PKDHMMZDRVQH1CMRE5T80","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PKEJFG8VQS39DKP2S6Q0K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PKFJC8886TX9RG0P1ZA0V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PKGME1N6MSP260R3XE3QJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n髪型4変化🤸‍♀️メッセージではいつもちょっとした動画編集してアレンジ集を送っています🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアアクセサリーを大量購入しました💛また新たなアレンジお楽しみにーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でまたね( ˙-˙ )/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PKHKVH8AR2J5GG8C6D9V2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}